This repository contains files under DIFFERENT terms. There is no single
licence for the whole repository.

1. Files written for this repository -- the documentation, .spiceinit, and
   model files named *_Repo.lib -- are released under the MIT licence,
   see LICENSES/MIT.txt.

2. Every other file under models/ was published by a third party
   (semiconductor vendors, simulator vendors, model developers, community
   collections). Those files are NOT covered by the MIT licence and are NOT
   relicensed here. They remain under their owners' terms, which are quoted
   in each file's header ("* @licence:") and summarised in NOTICE.md. Each
   file's header also gives the original download location ("* @url:").

The models are collected for non-commercial education and research
(courses and projects at IIIT Hyderabad). They are provided as is, without
any warranty; use them at your own risk. Where possible, prefer downloading a
model directly from its publisher (see the @url line).

Copyright holders: if you do not want a file to be included here, please open
an issue on this repository and it will be removed promptly.
